warning[use_after_free]: strict mode: `p` may be used after release along a bad path; shortest bad path shown (0 other bad paths)
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/strict/resources.jai:39:10
   |
37 |     p := alloc();
   |          ------- storage derived here
38 |     if flag release(p);
   |        ---- shortest bad path takes this condition as true
   |             ---------- storage invalidated here
39 |     sink(p);
   |          ^
   |
   = help: free it after its last use, or give it a new value before using it again
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free/

